{"ref":"BDB, אָבִיר","hw":"אָבִיר","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">אָבִיר</span>]</big>  <strong>adj. strong</strong>; alw.= subst. <em>the Strong</em>, old name for God (poet.); only cstr. in <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲבִיר יַעֲקֹב</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 49:24\" href=\"/Genesis.49.24\">Gn 49:24</a> & thence <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:2\" href=\"/Psalms.132.2\">ψ 132:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:5\" href=\"/Psalms.132.5\">5</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.26\">Is 49:26</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.16\">60:16</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ יִשְׂרָאֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.24\">Is 1:24</a> (cf. Che crit. n.)—Ba<sup>NB 51</sup> assigns this cstr. to <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבִּיר</span>.","next":"BDB, אַבִּיר","prev":"BDB, אָבַר"}